          "snippet": {
            "line": 582,
            "text": "theorem familyDensity_rate_eq (a m p : E → ℝ) (d δ : ℝ) (hd : d ≠ 0) (hδ : 0 < δ)\n    (x : E) (hx : 0 < a x) (θ : ℝ) :\n    (familyDensity a m p d δ hd hδ x).rate θ =\n      phaseDensity (a x) (seedSpeed (a x) (m x) δ) (seedTilt (a x) (m x) d (p x) δ θ) /\n        (2 * Real.pi)"
